An array containing a pinned messages and its pinned_at timestamp.

@link https://docs.discord.com/developers/resources/message#message-pin-object
@since 10.19.0
@property \Carbon\Carbon $pinned_at The time the message was pinned
@property \Discord\Parts\Channel\Message\Message $message The pinned message.

An array containing a pinned messages and its pinned_at timestamp.

@link https://docs.discord.com/developers/resources/message#message-pin-object
@since 10.19.0
@property \Discord\Helpers\ExCollectionInterface<\Discord\Parts\Channel\Message\MessagePin>|\Discord\Parts\Channel\Message\MessagePin[] $items
@property bool $has_more
@phpstan-property ExCollectionInterface<MessagePin> $items

Represents a message reference object, which points to another message for replies, forwards, pins, etc.

@since 10.11.2
@link https://docs.discord.com/developers/resources/message#message-reference-structure
@property int|null $type Type of reference (0 = DEFAULT, 1 = FORWARD).
